## User

The sum of the values in a binary tree.

## Context

```bend
type Tree is Data:
  Leaf{}
  Node{left: Tree, value: Nat, right: Tree}
```

## Type

type
```bend
def tsum(t: Tree) -> Nat:
```

## Term

```bend
match t:
  case Leaf{}:
    1n
  case Node{left, value, right}:
    match value:
      case 0n:
        1n
      case 1n+p:
        +p2 = p
        +t2 = tsum(t)
        Nat.add(p, Nat.add(t2, t2))
```

